<title>ITALY: Milan bourse trading blocked due technical hitch.</title>
<headline>Milan bourse trading blocked due technical hitch.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share-trading on the Milan stock market was halted due to a technical problem, a Bourse Council spokesman said.</p>
<p>Trading in Bourse futures was not affected.</p>
<p>Further information would be given as soon as possible.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
